{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/pulls/63","id":5168506092,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUw2uXs8AAAABNBEk7A","html_url":"https://github.com/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/pull/63","diff_url":"https://github.com/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/pull/63.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/pull/63.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/issues/63","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/pulls/63/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/pulls/63/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/issues/63/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladKochetov007/WunderFunder/statuses/d9dc93495d15fe8fdbd8b022e456f048212e451a","number":63,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Experiment] Curvature-matched Huber on B300","user":{"login":"Ivanhacker13","id":145894116,"node_id":"U_kgDOCLIq5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145894116?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivanhacker13","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivanhacker13/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# [Experiment] Curvature-matched Huber versus weighted MSE\n\n1. **Status.** Implements `huber_curvature` using the existing weighted Huber\n   kernel and exposes a source-qualified 2+2 GPU recipe. Receiver checks and\n   profiles pending; no local tests, inference, training or results.\n2. **Why.** Large residuals may dominate weighted MSE gradients. The treatment\n   caps their gradient growth; matching near-zero curvature controls one scale\n   confound. Earlier Huber was weaker than WMSE in team reports, so this is a\n   targeted continuation with negative prior evidence, not a novel claim.\n3. **Compute.** Four independent single-GPU GRU fits, plus receiver profiles and\n   prediction export; no extra inference modules. B300 speed is unmeasured.\n4. **Comparison.** Cold label-only GRU256x2, raw112, six epochs, AdamW 0.001,\n   FP32, same masks and label weights; WMSE vs `2*Huber(delta=0.5)`, fixed final\n   epoch. Only local objective curvature is matched, not full optimization.\n5. **Fits.** F0/1001 and F2/1002 × 2 arms = four new fits. No assumed reused\n   parents, teachers or controls. Exact source and fold lineage must be verified.\n6. **Validation.** Official pooled global weighted Pearson, identical evaluation\n   rows, t0/t1 and all paired deltas. Two cells confound fold and seed; all existing\n   folds are development-exposed. Bootstrap of fixed predictions is conditional.\n7. **Leakage.** Full component-qualified fitting membership, fit-only statistics,\n   no future labels as inputs or outer-score checkpoint selection. The split loader\n   and official masks must be verified against actual supplied files on receiver.\n8. **Decision.** +0.0005 WP is a preliminary follow-up signal, not significance.\n   Mixed/small results are uncertain; negative results constrain this exact recipe.\n   A component interval crossing zero alone does not close the direction.\n9. **Run.** See packet README for commands, clean prediction export, scorer and\n   resource profile. Missing dataset paths, fold manifests and B300 receipt are\n   explicit prerequisites; no remote jobs have been started.\n10. **Evidence.** Preserve source/config/data/fold hashes, training logs and\n    preclip gradients, optimizer clocks, runtime/VRAM, all grade and prediction\n    manifests and separate evidence/weights archive SHA256s. Source identity v2\n    rejects exact resume from v1; no silent continuation of older jobs.\n11. **Results.** Zero fits, scores, CPU serving tests, leaderboard claims or\n    ready submissions. Any downstream KD or fixed-mixture contribution is a\n    separately budgeted study.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-05T08:29:45Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T08:32:41Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"df644952ac490763685de0ea031ff9dc64556d52","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"VladKochetov007:codex/huber-tail-b300-20261105","ref":"codex/huber-tail-b300-20261105","repo":{"id":1393405534,"node_id":"R_kgDOUw2uXg","name":"WunderFunder","full_name":"VladKochetov007/WunderFunder","owner":{"login":"VladKochetov007","id":63206087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjA2MDg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63206087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VladKochetov007","html_url":"https://github.com/VladKochetov007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VladKochetov007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VladKochetov007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VladKochetov007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VladKochetov007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VladKochetov007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VladKochetov007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VladKochetov007/repos","events_url":"